// spec: in a scoped library (design.md 16), a namespace-scope `auto` lambda is called above its declaration by the library's own member function and by the program through the library's name: the library's top level is the scope the lambda's initializer is typed in for the use above, as its file's walk types it (`12 9`)
int main()
{
  shapes::Square s;
  s.side = 3;
  std::println(s.area() + 3, " ", shapes::sq(3));
  return 0;
}
